From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Disable private space in the launcher

Android 17 port of the launcher half of /e/OS a16 9e0eb9a8 ("Disable
private space"): set com.android.launcher3 enable_private_space to
DISABLED in the cp2a value set (picked up through cp2a's */Android.bp).
The framework half (android.multiuser.enable_private_space_features) no
longer exists in Android 17; private profiles are disabled through a
config_user_types overlay in vendor/eos instead.

The a16 'Revert settings card layout' commit is not ported: the
com.android.settings.flags homepage_revamp flag is gone in Android 17.
---
 .../cp2a/com.android.launcher3/Android.bp     | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...enable_private_space_flag_values.textproto |  6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_private_space_flag_values.textproto

diff --git a/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/Android.bp b/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/Android.bp
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..e9ab2d26
--- /dev/null
+++ b/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/Android.bp
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+// Copyright 2025 Google Inc. All rights reserved.
+//
+// Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
+// you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.
+// You may obtain a copy of the License at
+//
+//     http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
+//
+// Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software
+// distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS,
+// WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
+// See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
+// limitations under the License.
+
+aconfig_values {
+  name: "aconfig-values-lineage-cp2a-com.android.launcher3-all",
+  package: "com.android.launcher3",
+  srcs: [
+    "*_flag_values.textproto",
+  ]
+}
diff --git a/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_private_space_flag_values.textproto b/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_private_space_flag_values.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..0e9310fd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/release/aconfig/cp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_private_space_flag_values.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "com.android.launcher3"
+  name: "enable_private_space"
+  state: DISABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
